# expect.stdout: 9\n
# expect.exit: 0
project UserOpThreeParamMixed
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder CSignedInt32

operation indexCharInPair
input operation indexCharInPair leftBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString
input operation indexCharInPair rightBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString
input operation indexCharInPair preferRight CSignedInt64
output operation indexCharInPair Result CSignedInt64 Void
memory indexCharInPair heap no
async indexCharInPair no
purpose operation indexCharInPair "Take two strings and a selector. When selector is non-zero return the length of rightBuffer; otherwise the length of leftBuffer. Exercises mixed-type param signatures (i8*, i8*, i64) and pointer-typed arg2 emission at call sites."
invariant operation indexCharInPair "Calls c.strlen on the chosen buffer."
label startIndexCharInPair
storage module immutable zeroSelectorThreshold CSignedInt64 0
call selectorPositiveCall math.greaterThanI64
argument selectorPositiveCall left CSignedInt64 preferRight
argument selectorPositiveCall right CSignedInt64 zeroSelectorThreshold
run selectorPositiveCall
bind value selectorPositive Bool selectorPositiveCall
branch if condition selectorPositive target measureRightBuffer
call leftLenCall c.strlen
argument leftLenCall s CNullTerminatedByteString leftBuffer
run leftLenCall
bind value leftLength CByteCount leftLenCall
return ok leftLength
label measureRightBuffer
call rightLenCall c.strlen
argument rightLenCall s CNullTerminatedByteString rightBuffer
run rightLenCall
bind value rightLength CByteCount rightLenCall
return ok rightLength

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main read memory.buffer
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "Call indexCharInPair('short', 'something', 1) which returns length 9 (length of 'something')."
invariant operation main "Exercises three-param user op with mixed i8*/i8*/i64 args."
label startMain
storage module immutable shortBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString "short"
storage module immutable longBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString "something"
storage module immutable useRightSelector CSignedInt64 1
call measureCall indexCharInPair
argument measureCall leftBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString shortBuffer
argument measureCall rightBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString longBuffer
argument measureCall preferRight CSignedInt64 useRightSelector
run measureCall
bind ok measuredLength CSignedInt64 measureCall
memory main mutable measuredStorage I64 0
set memory measuredStorage measuredLength
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value I64 measuredStorage
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
